{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"f0fc84eb2041fb447073ebfcf11b95339f39c7b869bfa86c738a192d0525760a","digest":{"component_or_area":"test infrastructure / Git version requirements","key_entities":[".github/git-version-floor.txt","tests/conftest.py","tests/_git_floor.floor_violation()","pytest_configure",".github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml","tests/unit/test_git_version_floor.py","git merge-tree --write-tree","tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py","test_enrichment_drain_preserves_two_clone_union"],"problem_keywords":["git version floor","merge-tree capability","test guard","regression","version requirement"],"propositions":["The two-clone enrichment regression (bug 8185) requires Git 2.38+ for git merge-tree --write-tree capability but the repository does not declare or enforce a Git version floor.","Git version floor must be explicitly declared, centrally sourced, and enforced with a clear failure message before test collection rather than silently skipped on older clients.","Gating CI environments must explicitly verify the Git version floor is met and execute the merge-tree regression on every pipeline run.","A skip-based guard would cause the 8185 regression to silently not run on some contributors, creating vacuous coverage similar to previous guard rot (34c2, 8a5e)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787745718246272001,"uuid":"054281b4-0036-4abf-a13f-d621457ab04d"}